1
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:45,390
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,410 --> 00:00:47,040
[Episode 6]

3
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:47,430
[Adapted from Migu's novel
"Unsoiled Starlight"]

4
00:00:47,450 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Author: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:11,200
My head hurts.

6
00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:14,320
Shu…

7
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:16,520
left me on the couch all night?

8
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:25,200
My head hurts.

9
00:01:29,830 --> 00:01:31,600
Why are there two sets?

10
00:01:32,590 --> 00:01:33,800
Shu?

11
00:01:34,690 --> 00:01:35,840
Shu?

12
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:41,920
Zhinan,

13
00:01:41,940 --> 00:01:42,670
you're here.

14
00:01:43,470 --> 00:01:44,360
Are you hungry?

15
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:45,800
Want to grab some breakfast?

16
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:46,250
Let's go.

17
00:01:46,250 --> 00:01:47,160
Wait.

18
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:49,640
Shu Tinglan,

19
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:53,820
something's off with you.

20
00:01:54,220 --> 00:01:55,220
Nothing’s wrong.

21
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,320
Is there someone

22
00:01:58,560 --> 00:01:59,410
in your room?

23
00:01:59,440 --> 00:02:00,240
No.

24
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:02,250
How could I do something like that?

25
00:02:03,100 --> 00:02:03,560
Zhinan!

26
00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:04,600
Zhinan!

27
00:02:04,810 --> 00:02:06,080
You have to believe me.

28
00:02:09,639 --> 00:02:10,169
Morning.

29
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:18,100
Zhinan.

30
00:02:18,570 --> 00:02:19,760
let me explain.

31
00:02:35,550 --> 00:02:36,520
So,

32
00:02:36,540 --> 00:02:38,960
Zhuo Yu'an was haunting you?

33
00:02:40,770 --> 00:02:42,840
Isn't that haunting enough?

34
00:02:44,410 --> 00:02:46,640
He's also your company's client?

35
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:54,040
Since high school…

36
00:03:02,220 --> 00:03:03,160
Please.

37
00:03:03,740 --> 00:03:04,680
Shu Tinglan,

38
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,450
what's gotten into you?

39
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:09,520
I was just being impulsive.

40
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:10,920
A man like this,

41
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:12,710
with a great face and body,

42
00:03:12,710 --> 00:03:13,710
who can even cook.

43
00:03:13,930 --> 00:03:15,410
Instead of making him your boyfriend,

44
00:03:15,410 --> 00:03:16,800
you made him your bed buddy?

45
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,640
You're seriously out of your mind.

46
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:19,120
But…

47
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:21,900
Wash your hands. It's time to eat.

48
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:24,600
Let's eat.

49
00:03:25,030 --> 00:03:25,460
Come on.

50
00:03:25,460 --> 00:03:26,640
Let's eat.

51
00:03:33,420 --> 00:03:34,060
Enjoy your meal.

52
00:03:34,060 --> 00:03:34,920
I'll get going.

53
00:03:35,110 --> 00:03:37,300
Mr. Zhuo, won't you stay for breakfast?

54
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:37,880
No.

55
00:03:38,270 --> 00:03:39,670
I have work at the office.

56
00:03:40,070 --> 00:03:42,079
Take care on your way.

57
00:03:45,130 --> 00:03:46,329
Get up and see him out.

58
00:03:46,820 --> 00:03:47,720
No need.

59
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:52,140
Remember to drink your milk
before it gets cold.

60
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:55,600
Goodbye, Mr. Zhuo.

61
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:03,400
In this love blogger's view,

62
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:04,900
a connection like this

63
00:04:04,920 --> 00:04:06,450
doesn't come around often.

64
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:07,440
Shu,

65
00:04:08,020 --> 00:04:09,480
What do you really want?

66
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:10,400
So you really won’t

67
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:12,200
try making it official with him?

68
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:15,560
Famous love blogger Lin Zhinan said

69
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,440
men are very good

70
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:20,640
at pretending to be gentle and caring.

71
00:04:20,730 --> 00:04:22,200
To get their way,

72
00:04:22,220 --> 00:04:23,360
if he likes you,

73
00:04:23,380 --> 00:04:24,710
he'll tell you for sure.

74
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:27,780
But Lin Zhinan also said

75
00:04:27,810 --> 00:04:29,530
don't listen to what a man says,

76
00:04:29,530 --> 00:04:31,280
but watch what he does.

77
00:04:33,990 --> 00:04:34,880
Tinglan,

78
00:04:35,470 --> 00:04:37,480
I'll buy you the best.

79
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:37,800
Okay.

80
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:38,480
Whatever you like,

81
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,860
I'll get it for you, okay?

82
00:04:39,860 --> 00:04:40,440
Okay.

83
00:04:40,940 --> 00:04:41,580
Come here.

84
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:42,240
Let Dad

85
00:04:42,950 --> 00:04:43,570
give you a hug

86
00:04:43,570 --> 00:04:45,370
and see if you've gained weight!

87
00:04:47,550 --> 00:04:49,280
You're my only precious girl.

88
00:04:49,380 --> 00:04:51,320
I'll always love you and only you,

89
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,280
okay?

90
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:55,520
Up we go!

91
00:04:56,570 --> 00:04:58,040
-You homewrecker!
-Mom…

92
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,570
-You wicked woman!
-Mom...

93
00:04:59,570 --> 00:05:00,920
Why did you seduce my husband?

94
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,760
-It's me, Mom!
-You ruined my family!

95
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:04,360
You shameless woman!

96
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:06,080
You've ruined my life!

97
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:10,920
But…

98
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:14,720
Does making it official
guarantee lifelong loyalty?

99
00:05:21,780 --> 00:05:22,720
Shu,

100
00:05:23,260 --> 00:05:25,040
I know what’s holding you back.

101
00:05:25,930 --> 00:05:26,800
You can't use

102
00:05:26,970 --> 00:05:28,420
your dad’s mistakes

103
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:30,640
to punish your present and future self.

104
00:05:30,950 --> 00:05:33,080
You have to take that first step.

105
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,360
What if

106
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:35,280
Zhuo Yu'an

107
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:37,040
is actually right for you?

108
00:05:56,159 --> 00:05:57,620
I'll check this proposal.

109
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:58,840
Zhuo Yu'an!

110
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:02,470
Jane.

111
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:05,290
Didn't I give you a week off?

112
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:06,760
You know me.

113
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,680
I'm full of energy.

114
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,450
No need to make time to rest.

115
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:12,240
That's perfect.

116
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:14,300
Go check on the project with Wang Yan.

117
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,120
You're still so cold.

118
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:22,280
I remember when you were abroad,

119
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:24,960
you couldn’t stand suits and ties.

120
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:27,610
You've changed your ways already?

121
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:30,130
People here judge you by how you dress.

122
00:06:33,280 --> 00:06:33,880
What?

123
00:06:34,280 --> 00:06:36,880
Do you have to wear women's perfume too?

124
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,690
It got on me by accident.

125
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:46,240
Are you…

126
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,460
secretly dating someone?

127
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:50,840
No.

128
00:06:55,460 --> 00:07:01,650
[Hongzheng Law Firm]

129
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:58,730
Zhuoyuan Technology's bidding meeting
is next Monday.

130
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:01,000
Let's put in some extra work

131
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,260
over the next few days.

132
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,130
Let's give it our all!

133
00:07:04,130 --> 00:07:04,770
Got i!

134
00:07:09,820 --> 00:07:13,900
[Hongzheng Law Firm]

135
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:14,480
I'm heading out.

136
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,160
Lawyer Xiao,

137
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,120
make a copy of this.

138
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:16,520
Okay.

139
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:39,850
Shu Tinglan,

140
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:41,530
wash your hands and eat.

141
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:43,930
Shu Tinglan,

142
00:07:44,159 --> 00:07:45,020
did you hear me?

143
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:46,530
Go ahead and eat.

144
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:55,960
Work after you eat.

145
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:58,960
I'm not hungry. Go ahead.

146
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:04,680
Time to eat.

147
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:06,040
Just eating won't cut it.

148
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,200
I'm not eating.

149
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,240
Do you know

150
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:11,160
how hard your project is to handle?

151
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,760
What I really need

152
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:15,440
is a super caring personal assistant.

153
00:08:23,200 --> 00:08:23,640
Got it.

154
00:08:24,280 --> 00:08:25,080
Finish your meal,

155
00:08:25,080 --> 00:08:26,610
and I'll be your assistant.

156
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:31,280
Really?

157
00:08:34,030 --> 00:08:34,919
Really.

158
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,960
You'd better keep your word.

159
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:39,799
I always do.

160
00:08:40,799 --> 00:08:42,860
Thanks for cooperating, Assistant!

161
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,760
Ride to the office with me later.

162
00:08:57,040 --> 00:08:57,560
No need.

163
00:08:58,560 --> 00:08:59,920
I need to get there early.

164
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:00,450
Besides,

165
00:09:00,520 --> 00:09:02,400
I've checked the bus schedule.

166
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,660
Don’t worry about being late.

167
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:06,680
If I'm not there,

168
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:08,080
the bidding can't start.

169
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:09,240
Still no.

170
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:11,200
Besides...

171
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:16,700
What are you doing?

172
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:18,800
Your lipstick is too bright.

173
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:19,760
It’ll throw off

174
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:21,020
the reviewers’ focus.

175
00:09:22,560 --> 00:09:24,120
I’m not presenting.

176
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:26,440
However,

177
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:28,240
you do have a point.

178
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:30,400
For such a formal occasion,

179
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:33,200
what color should I wear?

180
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:02,320
There.

181
00:10:09,910 --> 00:10:10,760
Shu Tinglan.

182
00:10:13,890 --> 00:10:14,490
Good luck.

183
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:28,400
Hongzheng Law Firm.

184
00:10:29,250 --> 00:10:31,610
[Zhuoyuan Technology Bid Presentation]

185
