191
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:51,380
The bidding conference
officially begins now!

192
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:00,680
Hello, everyone.

193
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:02,480
Here is our firm's bid proposal.

194
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:03,360
First of all,

195
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:04,520
our advantage lies

196
00:11:04,520 --> 00:11:06,440
