207
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:35,120
Thank you.

208
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:40,680
Go ahead.

209
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:41,400
Me?

210
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,640
Believe in yourself.

211
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:04,080
Now is Hongzheng Law Firm's…

212
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:13,600
bid proposal

213
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:15,720
